<title>USA: U.S. DAP and ammonia prices holding steady.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP and ammonia prices holding steady.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diammonium phosphate and ammonia prices were steady Monday and looked set to remain stable in the short-term. Dealers noted the price outlook should start to become clearer after a key convention in New Orleans next month.</p>
<p>			     Dlrs/short ton   Chg from Friday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla		172-174		 unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf	  185-187		 unc</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		160-165		 unc</p>
<p>(na - not available, nc - no comparison)</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
